{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/473574-east-asia-east-asia-rewrites-ahoy","id":473574,"title":"East Asia? East Asia. (Rewrites Ahoy!)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-08T18:17:45-07:00","id":473574,"title":"East Asia? East Asia. (Rewrites Ahoy!)","content":"I'm baaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaack.<br /> <br /> Hey guys, remember me? I'm that guy who, back during the early days of this forum, rewrote the Kami to better make sense with the source mythology? Remember how I promised to also do the Shen and then vanished from the face of the earth? Me too.<br /> <br /> But I was around for the great GBN vanishing, and that means that the framework for my Kami rework kind of vanished, which means that I had to rework them again. In any case, hunting through things, I found out about this Scion 2.0 project (<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/home\" target=\"_blank\">https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/home</a>), which appears to be in development, and since they've done the Deva and the Tuatha de Danann , I had enough of a framework to rebalance and fiddle with Harae to better match the insane scaling those purviews get later on.<br /> <br /> However, redoing mechanics (and likely failing at that) reinvigorated my love of game design, and so y'all get not one, but TWO rewrites from me!<br /> <br /> Reintroducing... The Grand Kami Rewrite 2.0: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1b6jHwEvBo72L7Bj1f0pNdmlNMFmvOIKZ__lr5eavOB0/\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...KZ__lr5eavOB0/</a><br /> and Introducing... The Great Shen Rewrite: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UfUpMDWMmcc3UVGJEguMorDyw6EeoJ9m3nwFmEO8o9E/\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...9m3nwFmEO8o9E/</a><br /> <br /> Both done by yours truly.<br /> <br /> Take my mechanics with a grain of salt, or perhaps a shaker. Harae 2.0 and Dao are both done basically by me staring at the 2.0 Enech and Atman purviews and mirroring what's there. Also, if you're running a campaign without Storms as a purview, just give them all Sky, which should help. Regardless of what houserules you're using, my purviews may be a bit off, so playtest and tweak and see what works, and check back at the docs every so often, I may add more and fiddle with mechanics as time goes by.<br /> <br /> Happy gaming,<br /> <br /> Sorcerymon.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1012,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1012-sorcerymon","user":"Sorcerymon","date":". 04-08-2015, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1012-sorcerymon","name":"Sorcerymon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1012_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T10:10:18-07:00","id":474453,"title":"","content":"Awesome work, mate. Thanks for all the time and effort you put into this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/972-fairlyhyperman","name":"Fairlyhyperman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}